of Service §4 (https://x.ai/legal/terms-of-service): as between the user and
SpaceXSI/xAI, the user retains ownership of User Content. Those terms allow the
project to distribute the pixels under Apache-2.0 (this is not a license from
xAI of Grok itself). Attribution required by those terms / Brand Guidelines:
Created with Grok. xAI Acceptable Use Policy
(https://x.ai/legal/acceptable-use-policy) forbids stripping embedded provenance
metadata or watermarks; the bundled JPEGs keep the Grok Imagine C2PA JUMBF.

