================================================================================
5. External services accessed at runtime (not distributed in this repository)
================================================================================

- Bing daily wallpaper API (https://www.bing.com/HPImageArchive.aspx):
  used only to display a wallpaper. Image copyright remains with the original
  authors / Microsoft Bing.
- wttr.in (https://wttr.in): weather text for the weather pill.
- Favicons / apple-touch-icon of websites the user adds as shortcuts: first
  paint uses a bundled tile, a cached data URL, or a letter placeholder
  (zero third-party requests). After the grid is ready the page may load the
  remote icon with a normal <img> (no fetch, no crossorigin). fetch() to an
  arbitrary https site happens only when the user clicks 重新抓取, which is
  why connect-src includes https: without extra host_permissions.

See README.md / README.zh-CN.md privacy sections.
